<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0081/tu_0004> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "For secondary prevention patients not achieving their goals on a maximum tolerated dose of a statin and ezetimibe, combination therapy including a PCSK9 inhibitor is recommended." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/semantic-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0081> <http://digistrucmed.org/semanticUnitId> "lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0081" .
