<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0081/e_0005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ezetimibe" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0081/na_0006> <http://digistrucmed.org/applicabilityExceptionStatus> "NONE_STATED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0081/gr_0015> <http://digistrucmed.org/gradingSystemName> "Source guideline grading" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0081/tu_0026> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "It is recommended that the first objective of treatment is to lower BP to <140/90 mmHg in all patients, and that subsequent BP targets are tailored to age and specific comorbidities." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0081/tu_0008/locator> <http://digistrucmed.org/headerPath> "SOURCE_DEFINED_OTHER: I" .
